<title>USA: MGM Pictures chief Marcus steps down.</title>
<headline>MGM Pictures chief Marcus steps down.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer Inc on Wednesday said Michael Marcus has resigned as president of MGM Pictures Inc.</p>
<p>In a statement, MGM, which was recently acquired by billionaire investor Kirk Kerkorian, said it will actively begin a search for an executive to replace Marcus.</p>
